flowchart TD
    Start[開始] --> Init[初期化]
    Init --> Spi[SPI 初期化]
    Spi --> SpiDrv[SpiDrv]
    SpiDrv --> SpiDrvInit[SpiDrv 初期化]
    SpiDrvInit --> Uart[UART 初期化]
    Uart --> UartTx[UART 送信]
    UartTx --> Check{送信可?}
    Check -->|はい| Send[送信]
    Check -->|いいえ| Wait[待機]
    Wait --> Check
    Send --> Done[終了]
